			"Message": "build(Mountain): Revert binary/library names to simplified \"Mountain\" identifier\n\nRevert the verbose development profile string (DevelopmentNodeEnvironment_MicrosoftVSCodeDependency_22NodeVersion_Bundle_Clean_Debug_ElectronProfile_EsbuildCompiler_Mountain) back to the simple \"Mountain\" name for binary, library, and default-run targets.\n\nThis simplifies the Tauri configuration by reverting productName and identifier to concise values (\"Mountain\" and \"land.editor.binary\" respectively). Also removes the duplicate \"Binary/node\" entry from externalBin in tauri.conf.json.\n\nBackup files (Cargo.toml.Backup, tauri.conf.json.Backup) are deleted as they are no longer needed.\n\nThe build pipeline continues to function correctly with the simplified naming scheme.",
